{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本標準依護理人員法（以下簡稱本法）第十六條第二項規定訂定之。","id":"L0020035/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"8621c0ab06b382203edcb8e19d57f893864a0667c7c91b8dc609a5c1720adf2d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"L0020035/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":30,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"護理機構分類如下：\n一、居家護理所：至受照顧者居（住）所提供護理及健康照護服務，並得於所內提供照護之服務、諮詢、指導、訓練或其他相關服務之機構。\n二、護理之家：提供受照顧者入住，並全時予以護理及健康照護服務之下列機構：\n（一）一般護理之家。\n（二）精神護理之家。\n（三）產後護理之家。\n前項護理及健康照護服務，包括個案之護理需求評估、健康促進、疾病預防與照護、長期失能、失智、安寧及其他全人照護。\n於第一項第一款居家護理所內提供服務者，以護理人員為限。","id":"L0020035/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"5f507d148af5a8127525651b4e5e178cac19de917a0a72609fac6e61bbe37ab4","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"L0020035/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":143,"children":[{"id":"L0020035/a:2/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":10,"end":73,"children":[]},{"id":"L0020035/a:2/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":73,"end":143,"children":[{"id":"L0020035/a:2/p:1/i:2/s:1","kind":"subitem","number":1,"start":110,"end":121,"children":[]},{"id":"L0020035/a:2/p:1/i:2/s:2","kind":"subitem","number":2,"start":121,"end":132,"children":[]},{"id":"L0020035/a:2/p:1/i:2/s:3","kind":"subitem","number":3,"start":132,"end":143,"children":[]}]}]},{"id":"L0020035/a:2/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":143,"end":199,"children":[]},{"id":"L0020035/a:2/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":199,"end":226,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"護理機構之設置基準如下：\n一、居家護理所設置基準如附表一。\n二、護理之家設置基準如附表二。","id":"L0020035/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"72a399ef6d0ca9bdc634cf5bec274f1411fcc2246b169be98a9cf814efc19f0b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"L0020035/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":45,"children":[{"id":"L0020035/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":13,"end":30,"children":[]},{"id":"L0020035/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":30,"end":45,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"產後護理之家，其服務對象以下列人員為限：\n一、產後未滿二個月之產婦。\n二、出生未滿二個月之嬰幼兒。\n前項服務對象，經醫師診斷有特殊需求者，得不受前項各款二個月之限制。","id":"L0020035/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"774de0d065faff35b84ccf991275e6d4e7e993906e77b2db021dbc74c09da3e1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"L0020035/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":50,"children":[{"id":"L0020035/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":21,"end":35,"children":[]},{"id":"L0020035/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":35,"end":50,"children":[]}]},{"id":"L0020035/a:4/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":50,"end":83,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"護理機構於其服務對象有醫療需求者，應轉介醫師診療；並得依其照護需求，轉介相關醫事人員提供服務。","id":"L0020035/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"07ab04f5a887226951974e6373576c30576b0419639365b33bb35703699049be","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"L0020035/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":47,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"護理機構就前條醫師診療及相關醫事人員依法執行業務之紀錄，應連同護理紀錄妥善保存。","id":"L0020035/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"20dc62b7f34d1dba2463500d3db815ec35d7748e18f71fa5c1c65b00943f8cc7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"L0020035/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":40,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"護理機構之負責資深護理人員，應督導其機構所屬護理人員及其他人員，善盡業務上必要之注意。","id":"L0020035/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"f7eda5b98069ef3d1ac1e6c34673d110e4bdc24a91a2636b23285972c152db69","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"L0020035/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":43,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"本標準自發布日施行。","id":"L0020035/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"0760487a7e1a3f98a433704c163a939df3ca09942ff350f224457b344857930a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"L0020035/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[{"title":"附表一  居家護理所設置基準.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000274258"},{"title":"附表二  護理之家設置基準.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000383587"}],"category":"目的事業與設立標準","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國八十二年八月二十七日行政院衛生署（82）衛署醫字第 82473\n  83  號令訂定發布全文 14 條\n2.中華民國八十五年三月二十七日行政院衛生署（85）衛署醫字第 85013\n  102 號令修正發布第 11 條附表\n3.中華民國八十七年六月十七日行政院衛生署（87）衛署醫字第 8703253\n  0 號令修正發布全文 11 條\n4.中華民國九十二年十月二十七日行政院衛生署衛署醫字第 0920216079\n  號令修正發布第 8  條條文之附表\n5.中華民國九十七年九月二十三日行政院衛生署衛署醫字第 0970205502 \n  號令修正發布名稱及第 2、3、9  條條文；並刪除第 10 條條文\n  （原名稱：護理機構設置標準；新名稱：護理機構分類設置標準）\n6.中華民國一百年十二月二日行政院衛生署衛署照字第 1002863077 號令\n  修正發布第 8  條條文之附表；並增訂第 10-1 條條文  \n7.中華民國一百零二年八月九日衛生福利部衛部照字第 1021580033 號令\n  修正發布第 8  條條文之附表\n8.中華民國一百零九年七月二十二日衛生福利部衛部照字第 1091561038\n  號令修正發布全文 8  條；並自發布日施行\n9.中華民國一百十一年九月六日衛生福利部衛部照字第 1111561167 號令\n  修正發布第 3  條條文之附表二\n10. 中華民國一百十四年一月二十二日衛生福利部衛部照字第 113156140\n    9 號令修正發布第 3  條條文之附表二","id":"L0020035","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2025-01-22","name":"護理機構分類設置標準","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=L0020035","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"2bcc6c5e5ecb1903a7c9a54ea1d65890584a98c1f547479150f4097f83548c14","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2025-01-22","effectiveDate":""}}